graph TD
    subgraph User Activity Monitoring
    UA1(Clickstream Ingestion) --> UA2(Real-Time Event Processing)
    UA2 --> UA3(User Profile Updates)
    end

    subgraph Catalog Ingestion & Enrichment
    CI1(Product Data Feed) --> CI2(Data Validation & Cleaning)
    CI2 --> CI3(Image Feature Extraction)
    CI2 --> CI4(Textual Feature Extraction)
    CI3 & CI4 --> CI5(Enriched Product Catalog)
    end

    UA3 --> RS1(Query Understanding & Context)
    CI5 --> RS1

    subgraph Recommendation Service
    RS1 --> RS2{Query Intent: Fuzzy Match?}
    RS2 -- Yes --> RS3(Keyword Expansion & Correction)
    RS2 -- No --> RS4(Semantic Similarity Search)
    RS3 --> RS4
    RS4 --> RS5(Candidate Product Retrieval)
    RS5 --> RS6(Re-Ranking & Filtering)
    RS6 --> RS7(Personalization Layer)
    RS7 --> RS8(Result Aggregation & Prioritization)
    RS8 --> RS9(Product Recommendation Response)
    end

    RS9 --> FE1(Frontend Display)
    style RS3 fill:#f9f,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    classDef highlight fill:#ccf,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    class UA1,UA2,UA3,CI1,CI2,CI3,CI4,CI5,RS1,RS2,RS3,RS4,RS5,RS6,RS7,RS8,RS9,FE1 highlight